TITLE Mix then heat with calcite equil (REACTION_TEMPERATURE in same simulation)
SOLUTION 1 DIC solution
    temp 20
    pH   7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
SOLUTION 2 Ca solution
    temp 20
    pH   7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca   50
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -pH true
    -temperature true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO
END
END
